  "label": "Family Bonding Through Cooking",
  "description": "The cultural concept that preparing meals together is a way to strengthen familial relationships. This is implied by the affectionate interaction between the mother and daughter in the image and the shared activity of making sandwiches, which is often seen as a bonding ritual in many households.",
